              "name": "Installation guides in Settings",
              "context": "Part of /settings. No separate installation route. Reading order: Safari guide, Chrome guide, Safari progress transfer, offline readiness. Two equal columns when available content width is at least 640px; stack on smaller widths. Each guide is a labelled section containing an ordered list.",
