    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "CpDyr",
      "x": 10710,
      "y": 16272,
      "name": "MOBILE / 14 Study · photo question",
      "context": "Full-page mobile specification at 390 px. At a normal viewport, the 86 px bottom bar remains visible while content scrolls; preserve a safe-area inset and make the last action reachable. Canvas height expands to show all content. Each question accepts one answer per study session. No Retry question action. Previous and Next retain current-session answers and feedback. Entering Study again or opening a question from a learning-status filter in Progress starts a fresh session. Leaving study, changing mode or group, reloading, or restarting a completed pass clears session answers, but preserves positions, attempt history, learning status and progress. Study hides the brand header below 1024px, including tablets; navigation and safe-area spacing remain. Active question screens show a full-width status bar 8px below the scope title.",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light"
