        {
          "id": "y8OhR",
          "type": "ref",
          "ref": "CqIvD",
          "name": "Telefon Navigation",
          "context": "Persistent bottom navigation: 62 px interaction area plus 24 px illustrated safe area. Fix to viewport bottom in the app. Scrolling content reserves its full height; the last action must remain reachable above it. Six equal navigation targets in order: Home, Study, Mock test, Progress, Cheat sheet, Settings. 86 px bar including 24 px illustrated safe area; 58 px targets. Labels reserve two lines; keep icon baselines aligned. Translate each item and expose its full accessible name.",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4302,
