          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Placement: right edge of the question container, below progress; vertically centered with the question status badge. In result review, place below the question count.\nOff: outlined surface. On: solid accent with a Check icon (10 px) for a non-color selected cue.\nNative toggle button: stable accessible name “Show English translation”; aria-pressed false / true. Tooltip on hover and focus: “Show English translation” / “Hide English translation”.\nEnter or Space toggles English question and choices; keep focus on the button. Focus: 2 px focus-ring outline with a 2 px gap. Reading order: progress → status → translation → question. Preserve translation preference and hide this control in German UI and live mock tests.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
