                      "context": "English rendering of source group 1. Translate all prose through the selected UI language; retain German study terms. Source edition: 2026-09-26. Full-width group surface; prose stays within 760 px, aligned with the header title on desktop. Tablet/mobile use 16 px body insets and fluid wrapping. Normal page scrolling; no fixed-height or nested scrolling.",
