          "name": "Telefon Navigation",
          "context": "Fixed bottom navigation; six equal targets, each at least 44 px wide. Allow two-line translated labels; increase bar height for longer locales. Reserve bar height plus safe-area inset in page content. Canvas shows full scroll content. Six equal navigation targets in order: Home, Study, Mock test, Progress, Cheat sheet, Settings. 86 px bar including 24 px illustrated safe area; 58 px targets. Labels reserve two lines; keep icon baselines aligned. Translate each item and expose its full accessible name.",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 3634,
