    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "q7rdc",
      "x": 4340,
      "y": 5690,
      "name": "SETTINGS + CHEAT SHEET / Full-width responsive layout specification",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1160,
      "fill": "$bg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gXYS2",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Full-width Settings & Cheat sheet",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 32,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "E2so5f",
          "name": "Page sizing",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Use the Progress page shell: desktop at 1024 px and above has a 236 px sidebar and 46 px side gutters. The main area, page heading, sections and accordion groups fill all remaining width. At 1440 px, content is 1112 px wide; at 1024 px, 696 px; at 1920 px, 1592 px. No 50vw or 760 px cap on the page container.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UQPyf",
          "name": "Responsive structure",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tablet uses top navigation, 36 px gutters and two-column preference fields / installation guides. Below 768 px, use mobile bottom navigation, 20 px gutters and stacked fields / guides. Preserve reading order: preferences, backup and comparison, reset, installation, offline status. Narrow import comparison stays fully readable. At zoom or long translations, reflow controls and preserve their labels and at least 44 px targets.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OWCo2",
          "name": "Reading and drawers",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Cheat sheet uses the Progress separated accordion appearance: 16 px between groups, tinted header, 16 px padding, 8 px corners, trailing chevron and a continuous expanded group surface. Keep all 14 groups in source order. Expanded prose remains a single column of at most 760 px, shrinking to available space. All groups toggle independently; the bottom Close group action restores heading focus. No modal drawer or nested scroll.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HNnfE",
          "name": "Navigation and state",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Mobile artboards show full scroll content with navigation at the end. In implementation keep bottom navigation fixed, reserve its full height plus safe-area inset, and keep every control reachable above it. Preserve Settings confirmation dialogs, invalid-backup / past-date feedback, selected values and backup data. Download remains before the Cheat sheet groups.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fIFPh",
          "name": "Verification checklist",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Verified in the design editor: 20 page variants checked with no clipped nodes; rendered desktop 1024 / 1440 / 1920, tablet 820, mobile 390 and narrow 320 details. Tablet containers also checked at 768 px. Reviewed expanded/collapsed groups and dark surfaces. Header text contrast is 4.74:1 light and 5.89:1 dark; body text on group surface is 5.46:1 light and 7.73:1 dark. Keyboard, zoom, scrolling, translated runtime reflow and physical-device behavior are specified, not runtime-tested.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
